    <title>Vol.24 攀岩女孩Lux&amp;阿黎：攀岩那么苦，为什么还那么爱它</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660950952d9eae5d0a282e68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660950952d9eae5d0a282e68</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Mar 2024 12:01:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期关于攀岩的节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和盖盖带着对攀岩的极大好奇，邀请了身边两位攀岩女孩——lux和阿黎，来向我们介绍他们攀岩的苦与乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lux每周都会选择一个地方野外攀岩。我既惊讶又佩服，攀岩的乐趣来自于哪里，它和其他运动有何不同？攀岩又如何重塑了他们的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>来听听我们的聊天吧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期嘉宾｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Lux：练习时长三年半的攀岩爱好者（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5768f02d6a6a6951b58b1c86?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=651008f700000000120058d6&amp;apptime=1711885658" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5768f02d6a6a6951b58b1c86?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=651008f700000000120058d6&amp;apptime=1711885658"><span>Lux大头蟹</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿黎：去年7月份入坑的攀岩girl（小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/53b0fe37b4c4d61d61012c25?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=651008f700000000120058d6&amp;apptime=1711885679" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/53b0fe37b4c4d61d61012c25?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=651008f700000000120058d6&amp;apptime=1711885679"><span>叫我阿黎</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜时间轴｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 入坑的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> “接受失败“是攀岩的必修课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 抱石、难度、野攀，有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> Lux的野攀经历：刻骨铭心的冲坠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 攀岩中无可避免的受伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 攀岩的神奇魅力：让不爱运动的人爱上了运动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1583">26:23</a> 比起运动，它更像一种生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 攀岩的矛盾与对立：失衡中寻找平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 受伤是勋章，为每一点微小的进步欢呼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2558">42:38</a> 攀岩可以训练一个人的“逆商”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a> 攀岩也是一个观赏性特别强的运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3087">51:27</a> 对攀岩新手有哪些建议？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3246">54:06</a> 阿黎的攀岩服装创业故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">61:01</a> 给听众的良好生活小建议</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜关于我们 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们是一档关于「良好生活」的成长型播客，从两个普通人的视角分享抵达良好生活之地的小经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>诗歌：从复旦经济学院到新闻学院，商业记者，想找到真正值得表达的东西，也想要「做事情」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>盖盖：做过投资、互联网战略、消费品牌，拥有怀疑和热情，手捧半个椰子碗，热爱散步，并相信「你永远不会错过任何真正的好东西」。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| 后期制作 |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>诗歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 野蔷薇 - 戴佩妮</span></p>]]></description>
